= Pork with egg and cheese crust

Ingredients:
pork chop slices (600g)
3 hardboiled eggs
eidam cheese (150g)
mayonaise
oil
salt, peper 

Preparation procedure:

1. Meat preparation
Tenderize the meat and add spices. 

2. Crust preparation
Grate cheese and eggs into a bowl and mix with 1-3 spoons of mayo. You can also add a pitch of salt and peper.

3. Fry the slices of meat in a pan on both sides to make them firm and juicy. 

4.Place the meat in a baking dish greased with oil. Layer the prepared cheese-egg mixture on each slice.

5.Bake in the oven on 180 °C for 30-45 minutes until the crust is golden brown.

6.Serve with potatoes or french fries, and don't forget some fresh vegetables. 

